From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xun2202 <98207886+Xun2202@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 17:31:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] downloads: recover interrupted final saves and wake resumed
 episodes

Recover an existing partial final document only when it matches the verified staged prefix. Reuse staging without resolving a stream and expose completion only after validating and registering the saved file. Deliver individual pause requests without waiting on unrelated writers, replace inactive worker entries, and log scheduler/save decisions with episode IDs.
